  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Desarrollo del Sistema Estadstico Nacional del Censo de Poblacin y Vivienda</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop the National Statistical System through the 2012 Population and Housing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El programa tiene como objetivo general contribuir al creciente uso de la informacin socio-demogrfica tanto en el sector pblico como en el privado. El objetivo especfico es que el pas disponga de informacin socioeconmica de poblacin y vivienda ms oportuna, confiable y estandarizada.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to contribute to the increased use of sociodemographic information in both the public and private sectors. The specific objective is for the country to have more timely, reliable, and standardized socioeconomic information available about its population and housing.</narrative>
  </description>
